    "body": "# What does this PR do?\n\nFixes #5940.\n\nAdds an optional `revision` to each Hugging Face dataset entry in `dataset_info.json` and forwards it to `datasets.load_dataset`. It accepts a branch, tag or commit SHA; omitting it preserves the default. Native Hugging Face Datasets cache behavior is unchanged.\n\nIncludes English and Chinese configuration docs and real CPU data-loading regressions using two published dataset commits with 298 and 300 records. The tests support the existing cold/online and warm/offline CI cache modes.\n\nValidation:\n- Data-loader tests: online 6 passed; warm offline 5 passed, 1 network-only case skipped.\n- `UV_NO_SYNC=1 PYTEST_ADDOPTS='-c pyproject.toml' make test`: 344 passed, 25 skipped, 3 xfailed, 4 xpassed.\n- `make license` and `make build`: passed.\n- Pre-commit on all six changed files: passed.\n- Full `make quality` fails on pre-existing W293 at `src/llamafactory/model/patcher.py:486`. Full `make commit` also reports existing formatting in `data/template.py`, `data/tool_utils.py` and `v1/plugins/model_plugins/kernels/ops/rms_norm/supa_rms_norm.py` (under `src/llamafactory/`). All four files are unchanged from base `47d407d`; formatter changes were restored.\n\nAI assistance was used for implementation, tests and review.\n\n## Before submitting\n\n- [x] Did you read the [contributor guideline](https://github.com/hiyouga/LlamaFactory/blob/main/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md)?\n- [x] Did you write any new necessary tests?\n",
